{"detail": {"templateUuid": "bbdd320739b44cde81c44e6ae2f6d520", "projectUuid": "8120723a06774d53b4c3c9eba8bfe7f3", "name": "如果古埃及神话从未停止运行", "description": "生命被克努姆塑造，圣甲虫承载太阳每日重生的想象\n拉让太阳的循环成为宇宙秩序；\n荷鲁斯连接天空与王权，阿努比斯守护亡者\n托特记录文字、知识与审判\n动物的形态也并非装饰，\n而是神力属性的一种视觉语言\n再往后，神的秩序进入人的世界\n法老借神祇建立王权，王权借仪式、文字与建筑获得形态\n直到最后，一整套关于生命、死亡、太阳和永恒的想象\n被写进石头，成为金字塔\n所以我没有想把古埃及简单“科幻化”\n机械在这里更像一种新的视觉语法—— 把那些原本看不见的秩序\n变成可以运转、拆解和重新组合的结构\n重述神话，不一定是改写故事\n也可以重新理解，古人曾经如何解释世界。\n\t\n原创AIGC短片，请勿侵权 BY@巫师光", "coverUrl": "/assets/07fc4a9e917f9d0a.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/87f8819bc8ba40efbcf30ebd76ab1d8a/eb0db7bb32c387b860e8201684328e5c26a5834a.mp4", "snapshotId": 40859, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 406066, "ownerUuid": "87f8819bc8ba40efbcf30ebd76ab1d8a", "avatar": "/assets/81964ae4048077a0.webp", "nickname": "巫师光", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 162, "tags": [{"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3061, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "4. 无问西东", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3061", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1305, "code": "concept_design", "tagLabel": "概念设计", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1305/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 5, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6a8bff52000000003300e4b5?xsec_token=AB-pn9e4JEUv5za03hQ0niKcYBTVmsmVOLqZSQCmCXOjk=&xsec_source=pc_user", "createAt": "2026年08月26日 13:10", "updateAt": "2026年08月31日 17:08", "publishAt": "2026年08月26日 13:10", "playCount": 609, "viewCreationProcessCount": 271, "copyCanvasCount": 49, "shareCount": 6, "snapshotPath": "/data/ca